<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Designer Deck Template v1</title>
    <style>
      @import url("https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap");

      :root {
        --ink: #111111;
        --muted: #6f7785;
        --line: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
        --blue: #4A89C8;
        --gray-light: #EAECEF;
        --gray-dark: #9AA4AF;
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      html,
      body {
        margin: 0;
        width: 1920px;
        height: 1080px;
        overflow: hidden;
        background: #ffffff;
        font-family: "Montserrat", sans-serif;
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      .slide {
        position: relative;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        background: #ffffff;
      }

      .header {
        position: absolute;
        left: 92px;
        top: 62px;
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 64px;
        line-height: 1.04;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.05em;
        width: 1736px;
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      .visit-bar-container {
        position: absolute;
        top: 340px;
        left: 120px;
        width: 1480px;
        height: 60px;
        display: flex;
      }

      .segment {
        height: 100%;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      }

      .history-segment {
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
        top: -60px;
        width: 640px;
        height: 180px;
        background: var(--blue);
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: 0 24px 48px rgba(74, 137, 200, 0.2), 0 8px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        flex-direction: column;
        z-index: 10;
        color: #ffffff;
      }

      .history-title {
        font-size: 44px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      }

      .history-support-inner {
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        margin-top: 12px;
      }

      .exam-segment {
        position: absolute;
        left: 640px;
        width: 300px;
        background: var(--gray-light);
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .decisions-segment {
        position: absolute;
        left: 940px;
        width: 540px;
        background: var(--gray-dark);
        color: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
      }

      .history-support-outer {
        position: absolute;
        top: 490px;
        left: 120px;
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: var(--muted);
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      }

      .proof-field {
        position: absolute;
        top: 460px;
        left: 860px;
        width: 740px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 56px;
      }

      .proof-row {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 24px;
      }

      .proof-marker {
        width: 40px;
        height: 4px;
        background: var(--blue);
        margin-top: 16px;
        border-radius: 2px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      .proof-content {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 8px;
      }

      .proof-title {
        font-size: 28px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--ink);
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      }

      .proof-desc {
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 400;
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.4;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      }

      .bottom-statement {
        position: absolute;
        top: 840px;
        left: 92px;
        font-size: 48px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--ink);
        letter-spacing: -0.04em;
        width: 1736px;
      }

      .footer-line {
        position: absolute;
        left: 112px;
        top: 992px;
        width: 1536px;
        height: 1px;
        background: var(--line);
      }

      .footer-logo {
        position: absolute;
        left: 1692px;
        top: 962px;
        width: 114px;
        height: 59px;
        object-fit: contain;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <section class="slide" aria-label="History is the cleanest place to reclaim minutes">
      <h1 class="header">History is the cleanest place to reclaim minutes.</h1>

      <div class="visit-bar-container">
        <div class="segment history-segment">
          <div class="history-title">History</div>
          <div class="history-support-inner">Relevant details • Timeline • Next questions</div>
        </div>
        <div class="segment exam-segment">
          Physical exam
        </div>
        <div class="segment decisions-segment">
          Decisions + counseling
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="history-support-outer">
        A high-leverage target for pre-visit prep.
      </div>

      <div class="proof-field">
        <div class="proof-row">
          <div class="proof-marker"></div>
          <div class="proof-content">
            <div class="proof-title">Foundational to the encounter</div>
            <div class="proof-desc">Shapes the starting point for what follows in the visit.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="proof-row">
          <div class="proof-marker"></div>
          <div class="proof-content">
            <div class="proof-title">Time-variable</div>
            <div class="proof-desc">Time required depends on complexity, communication, and context.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="proof-row">
          <div class="proof-marker"></div>
          <div class="proof-content">
            <div class="proof-title">Can begin before the encounter</div>
            <div class="proof-desc">A meaningful portion can start before the clinician is on the clock.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bottom-statement">
        But reclaiming those minutes still requires clinical judgment.
      </div>

      <div class="footer-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <img
        class="footer-logo"
        src="../../../../assets/logo/designer-health-logo-black.svg"
        alt=""
        aria-hidden="true"
      />
    </section>
  </body>
</html>
```
